{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2022-05-19 08:05:00', 'title': "MCDONALD'S AGREES TO SELL RUSSIAN BUSINESS TO CURRENT LICENSEE ALEXANDER GOVOR", 'text': "CHICAGO , MAY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOLLOWING ITS ANNOUNCEMENT THAT IT WILL EXIT THE RUSSIAN MARKET AND HAS INITIATED A PROCESS TO SELL ITS RUSSIAN BUSINESS, MCDONALD'S CORPORATION ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A SALE AND PURCHASE AGREEMENT WITH ITS EXISTING LICENSEE ALEXANDER GOVOR.\xa0 UNDER THIS AGREEMENT, MR."}